  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 87 × 2 − 80 ÷ 8 + 160 = 4\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) + and −\n\n87 × 2 − 80 ÷ 8 + 160 = 4 ⇒ 87 × 2 + 80 ÷ 8 - 160 = 4\n\n⇒ 87 × 2 + __**80 ÷ 8**__ - 160 = 4\n\n⇒ __**87 × 2**__ + 10 - 160 = 4\n\n⇒ __**174 + 10**__ - 160 = 4\n\n⇒ __**184 - 160**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 24 ≠ 4 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) + and =\n\n87 × 2 − 80 ÷ 8 + 160 = 4 ⇒ 87 × 2 − 80 ÷ 8 = 160 + 4\n\n⇒ 87 × 2 − __**80 ÷ 8**__ = __**160 + 4**__\n\n⇒ __**87 × 2**__ − 10 = 164\n\n⇒ __**174 − 10**__ = 164\n\n**⇒ 164 = 164 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) + and ×\n\n87 × 2 − 80 ÷ 8 + 160 = 4 ⇒ 87 + 2 − 80 ÷ 8 × 160 = 4\n\n⇒ 87 + 2 − __**80 ÷ 8**__ × 160 = 4\n\n⇒ 87 + 2 − __**10 **____**×**____** 160**__ = 4\n\n⇒ __**87 + 2**__ − 1600 = 4\n\n⇒ __89** − **____**1600**__ = 4\n\n⇒ -1511 ≠ 4 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) + and ÷\n\n87 × 2 − 80 ÷ 8 + 160 = 4 ⇒ 87 × 2 − 80 + 8 ÷ 160 = 4\n\n⇒ 87 × 2 − 80 + __**8 **____**÷**____** 160**__ = 4\n\n⇒ __**87 × 2**__ − 80 + 0.05 = 4\n\n⇒ __**174 + 0.05**__ − 80 = 4\n\n⇒ __174.05** − 80**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 94.05 ≠ 4 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
